## 🚀 Implementation Phases

Once approved, storefront development will proceed in **7 phases**:

### Phase 1: Setup & Utilities (1 day)
Create HCL API utility module at `scripts/hcl-cart-api.js`
- API wrapper functions
- Error handling
- Caching logic
- Event system

### Phase 2: PDP Integration (1 day)
Modify `blocks/product-details/product-details.js`
- Override Add to Cart button
- Call HCL API
- Show feedback
- Update mini-cart

### Phase 3: Mini-Cart Component (1 day)
Create `blocks/commerce-mini-cart/`
- New block for header cart display
- Dropdown interface
- Real-time updates
- Remove item buttons

### Phase 4: Cart Page Block (1 day)
Update/create `blocks/commerce-cart/`
- Full cart display
- Item management
- Checkout button
- Order summary

### Phase 5: Styling (1 day)
Add CSS for all new components
- Mini-cart styles
- Cart page styles
- Responsive design
- Accessibility styles

### Phase 6: Testing (1 day)
Comprehensive testing
- Unit tests
- Integration tests
- E2E tests
- Manual browser testing

### Phase 7: Error Handling (0.5 days)
Edge cases and robustness
- API timeouts
- Network errors
- Invalid data
- User feedback

